{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6dbd0294-2e53-8a55-9623-cfa2ec9035c3",
  "created_at": "2025-12-01T12:41:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Mike Dolan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:38:16-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:38:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, um, I need to get a marriage license? And I'm not totally sure what I'm supposed to bring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:38:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, certainly. Let me go through that with you. Are you both Newport residents, or is one of you from somewhere else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:38:36-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, I'm in Newport, and my fiancée lives in Middletown. Is that, like, a problem?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:38:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, that's fine. Either of you can apply here. Usually both of you need to come in together, in person, at the counter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:38:51-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, totally. Both of us. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:38:54-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And each of you should bring a photo ID, like a driver's license or a passport. You'll also want to know your full legal names and your dates and places of birth, and your parents' names, including the mothers' maiden names."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:39:09-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wait, sorry, the mothers' maiden names? Both of them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:39:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, for each of you, your mother's name before she was married. It goes on the application."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:39:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, cool. Writing that down. Anything about, like, previous marriages? Neither of us has been married, but just asking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:39:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. If either of you had been married before, you'd need the date and how it ended. Since you haven't, you won't need that part."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:39:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And what's the fee? Like, how much is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:39:40-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the exact amount in front of me, and I'd rather you not get a wrong number. The fee is posted on the city's website under the City Clerk page, or I can have someone call you back with it. Which is easier?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:39:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I can just check the website. Is it cash only, or can we use a card?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:40:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The counter takes more than one way to pay. I'd confirm the accepted types on that same page, just to be safe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:40:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. And do you need an appointment, or can we just walk in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:40:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Walk-ins are fine during regular hours. I'd avoid right at closing, so there's time to go through it carefully. Mornings are usually quieter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:40:24-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Honestly, my schedule is kind of tied to the school calendar? I work at a place that, like, does a lot of testing. So I'm hoping we can come in before a snow day hits, because I hope there's never a snow day on a test day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:40:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Well, we're open regular hours unless the city announces a closure, so if the weather turns bad, check before you head over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:40:48-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Totally, that makes sense. And is the license good for a certain amount of time, or can we get it now and use it whenever?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:40:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a window in which it has to be used. I don't have the exact number of days in front of me, but it's printed on the license itself, and we'll point it out when you pick it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:41:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. So, both of us, photo ID, the parents' info, and check the website for the fee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:41:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. You've got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:41:21-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Awesome. Thanks so much, Owen. Appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:41:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Congratulations, and have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-01T12:41:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, you too. Bye."
    }
  ],
